{"shortname": "doublesvsoop", "name": "Programming Without Coding Technology", "_id": "51356a075fcbc9792f4673fa", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/p/doublesvsoop/", "private": false, "short_description": "PWCT is not a Wizard for creating your application in 1 2 3 steps. PWCT is a general-purpose visual programming language designed for novice and expert programmers.\r\n\r\nA novice programmer can use PWCT to learn programming  concepts like Data Structures, Control Structures and Programming Paradigms. An expert programmer can use PWCT to create any large and complex software.\r\n\r\nUsing PWCT we developed a textual programming language Compiler and Virtual Machine without writing a single line of code where the programming process done using the PWCT visual components. This language called Supernova and it's free-open source.\r\n\r\nMany database, Multi-Media, Network, AI, Simulation & Math applications are developed using PWCT\r\n\r\nYou can see/edit the generated source code. PWCT support Harbour, Supernova, C, Python,  & C#.NET and you can extend PWCT to support code generation in any text based programming language.\r\n\r\nPWCT comes with many samples, tutorials and movies.", "creation_date": "2005-12-26", "summary": "Create software using a general-purpose visual programming system", "external_homepage": "http://doublesvsoop.sourceforge.net", "video_url": "www.youtube.com/embed/wpxbfPxNHqg?rel=0", "socialnetworks": [{"accounturl": null, "socialnetwork": "Twitter"}, {"accounturl": "http://www.facebook.com/doublesvsoop", "socialnetwork": "Facebook"}, {"accounturl": null, "socialnetwork": "Fediverse"}, {"accounturl": null, "socialnetwork": "Instagram"}], "status": "active", "moved_to_url": "", "preferred_support_tool": "_url", "preferred_support_url": "https://doublesvsoop.sourceforge.net", "developers": [{"username": "msfclipper", "name": "Mahmoud Fayed", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/u/msfclipper/"}], "tools": [{"name": "summary", "mount_point": "summary", "